  "slug": "slow-cooker-oatmeal",
  "name": "Slow Cooker Oatmeal",
  "recipe_type": "breakfast",
  "brief_description": "Use your slow cooker to make this oatmeal that is so creamy it's like tapioca! You will absolutely love this recipe. This is how oatmeal was meant to be!",
  "cuisine": null,
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Just before going to bed, combine the oats and water in a slow cooker. Set on Low, cover, and let cook overnight. In the morning, stir in the salt and half-and-half. Scoop into bowls, and sprinkle brown sugar over the top."
    }
  ],
